       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. AST-BOUNDARY.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 STORAGE-GROUP.
          05 FILLER PIC X VALUE SPACE.
          05 BASE-ITEM PIC X VALUE 'A'.
          05 FILLER REDEFINES BASE-ITEM PIC X.
          05 RANGE-START PIC X.
          05 RANGE-END PIC X.
          66 RANGE-ALIAS RENAMES RANGE-START THRU RANGE-END.
          05 TABLE-COUNT PIC 9 VALUE 1 BLANK WHEN ZERO.
          88 VALID-COUNT VALUE 1 THRU 9 11.
          05 TABLE-ITEM OCCURS 1 TO 2 TIMES
             DEPENDING ON TABLE-COUNT INDEXED BY TABLE-IDX PIC X.
          05 FILLER PIC X.
       01 CALL-TARGET PIC X(8) VALUE 'CHILD'.
       EXEC SQL
            INCLUDE SQLCA
       END-EXEC.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF TABLE-COUNT > 1 OR 2
               MOVE BASE-ITEM(1:1) TO RANGE-START
           ELSE
               CONTINUE
           END-IF.
           CALL 'EXT-PGM' USING BASE-ITEM.
           CALL CALL-TARGET USING BASE-ITEM.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING STORAGE-GROUP TO STORAGE-GROUP.
           EXEC CICS
                SYNCPOINT
           END-EXEC.
           GOBACK.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CHILD.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 CHILD-DATA PIC X VALUE 'C'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE CHILD-DATA TO CHILD-DATA.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM CHILD.
       END PROGRAM AST-BOUNDARY.
